    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kingsquarter, Craddockstown offers a superb collection of newly built 2 bedroom apartments, perfectly suited for those seeking modern living with a touch of convenience and style. These contemporary residences provide an exceptional opportunity to rent in one of Naas`s desirable locations with rents starting from 2,600 per month for the spacious two bedroom apartments.\n\nApartments are thoughtfully designed to maximise space and comfort with well proportion bedrooms, en suite, sleek and modern bathroom, spacious open plan kitchen, dining and living area which creates a bright and welcoming environment. The kitchen is equipped with appliances, ample storage with large windows flooding the living space with natural light,\n\nParking is available for residents, providing added convenience and peace of mind in this sought-after location. Whether you commute to Dublin or work locally, having a designated parking space is a valuable asset.\n\nKingsquarter is located a short distance from Naas Town, Naas Hospital, Vista Primary Care, Craddockstown Golf Club, a host of restaurants, cafes, bars, sports, and leisure facilities and a short drive to Millennium Park.\n\nAvailable from 7th October."
      },
